      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_brother_12",
      "hash64": "21B37E74C277DB51",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "99B2052E37E9E59B",
      "text": "Aber, Jo...![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "99B2042E37E9E3E8",
      "text": "Levy! So ein manipulatives Verhalten ist ein\\nabsolutes No-Go![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_27",
      "hash64": "23A6E69E05C99DE4",
      "text": "Sorry, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_28",
      "hash64": "23A6DD9E05C98E99",
      "text": "Jetzt haben wir dich schon fast dazu gezwungen,\\nan der Blaubeer-Liga teilzunehmen.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_29",
      "hash64": "23A6DC9E05C98CE6",
      "text": "Aber überleg doch mal! So könntest du deine\\nFreundschaft zu Jo vertiefen, hm?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_30",
      "hash64": "23A3DF9E05C75C28",
      "text": "Und keine Sorge, du hast natürlich meine volle\\nUnterstützung![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_31",
      "hash64": "23A3E09E05C75DDB",
      "text": "Jedenfalls solltest du dich jetzt auch offiziell\\nanmelden.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_32",
      "hash64": "23A3E19E05C75F8E",
      "text": "Komm, wir gehen direkt zum Empfang am\\nEingang.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_33",
      "hash64": "23A3E29E05C76141",
      "text": "Hehehe, da bist du ja! Hier kannst du dich\\nanmelden.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
